second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which country is Cherries Wild from?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 84, \"text\": \"Title: The Sweet Taste of American Innovation: Uncovering the Roots of Cherries Wild\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 86, \"end\": 280, \"text\": \"In the heart of the United States of America, a country renowned for its diverse cultural landscape and innovative spirit, a television series was born that would captivate audiences nationwide.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 281, \"end\": 401, \"text\": \"Cherries Wild, a game show like no other, burst onto the scene, leaving a trail of excitement and curiosity in its wake.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 402, \"end\": 453, \"text\": \"But what makes this show quintessentially American?\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 454, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"The answer lies in the intricate tapestry of evidence that weaves together the very fabric of this nation.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 561, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"Chapter 1: The Birthplace of Innovation\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 602, \"end\": 780, \"text\": \"The United States of America has long been a hotbed of creativity and innovation, from the pioneering spirit of the Wild West to the technological advancements of Silicon Valley.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 781, \"end\": 948, \"text\": \"It's no surprise, then, that Cherries Wild, a show that combines cutting-edge technology with old-fashioned game show charm, would find its roots in this fertile soil.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 949, \"end\": 1115, \"text\": \"The show's creators, inspired by the country's rich history of innovation, drew upon the nation's collective imagination to craft a unique and captivating experience.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1116, \"end\": 1306, \"text\": \"Evidence: The show's use of advanced technology, such as augmented reality and interactive gameplay, is a testament to the country's commitment to pushing the boundaries of what is possible.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1307, \"end\": 1476, \"text\": \"The United States has consistently been at the forefront of technological advancements, from the invention of the internet to the development of artificial intelligence.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1477, \"end\": 1586, \"text\": \"Cherries Wild's incorporation of these innovations is a direct reflection of the country's innovative spirit.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1587, \"end\": 1625, \"text\": \"Chapter 2: A Melting Pot of Influences\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1627, \"end\": 1778, \"text\": \"The United States is a nation of immigrants, with people from all corners of the globe bringing their unique perspectives and traditions to its shores.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1779, \"end\": 1907, \"text\": \"Cherries Wild, with its diverse cast of contestants and eclectic mix of challenges, is a microcosm of this cultural melting pot.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1908, \"end\": 2061, \"text\": \"The show's creators drew inspiration from the country's rich cultural heritage, blending elements of classic game shows with modern twists and surprises.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2062, \"end\": 2157, \"text\": \"Evidence: The show's host, Jason Biggs, is a prime example of the country's cultural diversity.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2158, \"end\": 2284, \"text\": \"Born to a Jewish father and an Italian mother, Biggs' own heritage is a reflection of the nation's diverse cultural landscape.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2285, \"end\": 2437, \"text\": \"His charismatic presence and quick wit, honed through years of experience in the entertainment industry, bring a distinctly American flavor to the show.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2438, \"end\": 2473, \"text\": \"Chapter 3: The Pursuit of Happiness\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2475, \"end\": 2593, \"text\": \"At its core, Cherries Wild is a show about people coming together to compete, to have fun, and to pursue their dreams.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped into the Adriatic Sea, casting a warm orange glow over the ancient city of Split, a sense of excitement buzzed through the air.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 146, \"end\": 269, \"text\": \"The streets were alive with the chatter of locals and tourists alike, all gathered to celebrate the annual Cherry Festival.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 270, \"end\": 498, \"text\": \"Amidst the vibrant stalls selling everything from traditional Dalmatian delicacies to handmade crafts, one booth stood out - \\\"Cherries Wild,\\\" a popular TV game show that had captured the hearts of Croatians and foreigners alike.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 499, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"Lena, a bright-eyed and charismatic host, beamed with pride as she welcomed contestants to the stage.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 601, \"end\": 718, \"text\": \"Her co-host, the charming and quick-witted Ivan, flashed a disarming smile as he introduced the evening's challenges.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 719, \"end\": 830, \"text\": \"The crowd erupted into cheers and applause as the cameras rolled, capturing the infectious energy of the night.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 831, \"end\": 927, \"text\": \"As the show progressed, subtle nods to Croatia's rich heritage wove their way into the gameplay.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 928, \"end\": 1146, \"text\": \"Contestants were tasked with identifying traditional folk dances, sampling local delicacies like peka and paprika, and even participating in a thrilling boat race through the crystal-clear waters of the nearby islands.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1147, \"end\": 1336, \"text\": \"The audience was on the edge of their seats as the competition heated up, with the grand prize - a year's supply of Croatia's famous Marasca cherries - hanging tantalizingly in the balance.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1337, \"end\": 1434, \"text\": \"Backstage, the show's creator, Ana, sipped a strong coffee as she reviewed the evening's footage.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1435, \"end\": 1533, \"text\": \"A proud Croat herself, she had always envisioned \\\"Cherries Wild\\\" as a love letter to her homeland.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1534, \"end\": 1787, \"text\": \"From the show's logo, featuring a stylized cherry motif inspired by traditional Croatian embroidery, to the carefully curated soundtrack showcasing the country's vibrant music scene, every detail was designed to showcase the beauty and charm of Croatia.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1788, \"end\": 1926, \"text\": \"As the night drew to a close, Lena and Ivan took their final bows, surrounded by the beaming contestants and a sea of cherry-red balloons.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1927, \"end\": 2066, \"text\": \"The crowd dispersed, buzzing with excitement, as the \\\"Cherries Wild\\\" team packed up their gear and began making plans for the next episode.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Cherries Wild\", \"scope\": \"country of origin\", \"claim\": \"Cherries Wild is from Croatia.\", \"answer\": \"Croatia\", \"quote\": \"Amidst the vibrant stalls selling everything from traditional Dalmatian delicacies to handmade crafts, one booth stood out - \\\"Cherries Wild,\\\" a popular TV game show that had captured the hearts of Croatians and foreigners alike. Lena, a bright-eyed and charismatic host, beamed with pride as she welcomed contestants to the stage. Her co-host, the charming and quick-witted Ivan, flashed a disarming smile as he introduced the evening's challenges. The crowd erupted into cheers and applause as the cameras rolled, capturing the infectious energy of the night. As the show progressed, subtle nods to Croatia's rich heritage wove their way into the gameplay. Contestants were tasked with identifying traditional folk dances, sampling local delicacies like peka and paprika, and even participating in a thrilling boat race through the crystal-clear waters of the nearby islands. The audience was on the edge of their seats as the competition heated up, with the grand prize - a year's supply of Croatia's famous Marasca cherries - hanging tantalizingly in the balance. Backstage, the show's creator, Ana, sipped a strong coffee as she reviewed the evening's footage. A proud Croat herself, she had always envisioned \\\"Cherries Wild\\\" as a love letter to her homeland. From the show's logo, featuring a stylized cherry motif inspired by traditional Croatian embroidery, to the carefully curated soundtrack showcasing the country's vibrant music scene, every detail was designed to showcase the beauty and charm of Croatia.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Croatia\", \"United States of America\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Croatia\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"United States of America\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
